==French==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/kɔ.pɛ̃/|lang=fr}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|cumpanis|lang=la}}, from whence English {{term|companion}}. The boyfriend meaning is by ellipsis of {{term|petit copain|lang=fr}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|m|f=copine}}

#  (male) [[friend]], [[chum]], [[mate]] (''UK''), [[pal]]
# {{informal|lang=fr}} [[boyfriend]] {{gloss|boy/man to which one has a romantic attachment}}

